+
+### PaymentSheet
+* [ADDED] Added support for SeQura.
+* [ADDED] Added support for PAYCO.
+* [ADDED] Added support for Korean cards.
+* [ADDED] Added support for Naver Pay.
+* [ADDED] Added support for Kakao Pay.
